{
  "question": "How would you like to handle the review findings?",
  "context": "## Review Summary\n6 findings across 4 personas. Two can be auto-fixed, four need a decision.\n\n### safe_auto (apply silently):\n1. Content audit: \"5 of 8 projects\" should be \"6 of 8 projects\" — dynastic-wealth does have a gallery entry\n2. IU-2 file path: Remove non-existent `src/components/project/ProjectPage.tsx` reference\n\n### Needs your decision:\n3. **Hash navigation approach** — Plan has two alternatives separated by \"or\" (onClick handler vs scrollBehavior). Pick one. Recommend: onClick handler (more reliable cross-page).\n4. **HTML sanitization** — StaticBody uses `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` without sanitization. Should we add DOMPurify or strip Webflow classes?\n5. **\"Back to work\" link** — Should IU-1 test scenarios include verifying this link isn't obscured by mobile menu? (low priority)\n6. **IU-3 priority** — Currently P1 but is a prerequisite for content to render. Should it be P0? (Sequencing already handles this correctly regardless.)",
  "options": [
    {
      "title": "Apply safe_auto fixes + proceed",
      "description": "Fix the two safe_auto issues (gallery count, file path) and continue with the plan as-is"
    },
    {
      "title": "Walk through findings one by one",
      "description": "Review each finding individually and decide on each"
    },
    {
      "title": "Auto-resolve with best judgment",
      "description": "Apply safe_auto fixes and use best judgment on the rest"
    },
    {
      "title": "Append findings to Open Questions",
      "description": "Add findings to the plan's Open Questions section and proceed"
    }
  ],
  "allowFreeform": true
}
